@@ -14,6 +14,10 @@ Help Texts
 Commands and options accept help arguments.  In the case of commands, the
 docstring of the function is automatically used if provided.
 
+.. versionchanged:: 7.1
+    Option help text preserves paragraphs separated by blank lines.
+    Lines within each paragraph are rewrapped to fit the terminal width.
+
 Simple example:
 
 .. click:example::
